# World Fund Engine

No owner. No CEO. No master switch.
Just circulation.

## Rules
1. Your earnings stay yours. We only split new revenue.
2. Splits: 35% People | 30% Company | 10% Hub | 25% World
3. Runs every 14 days. 
4. Open source. Fork it. Build on it.

## How to test
1. npm install
2. npm run dev
3. Send test revenue to /api/revenue
